WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:06.530
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.110
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:12.060
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.500 --> 00:20.180
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:41.260
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.260 --> 00:46.930
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.690
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.690 --> 00:53.710
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.910 --> 01:00.580
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.580 --> 01:05.590
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:06.000 --> 01:10.810
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:15.570
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.380
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:22.420
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.740
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.740 --> 01:29.670
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.670 --> 01:34.080
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:38.770
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.990
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:49.170
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:50.880 --> 01:54.460
<b>Kage's Yearning</b>

01:59.060 --> 02:02.020
<i>The shadow clan lived in the Kingdom of Bo.</i>

02:02.590 --> 02:08.400
<i>They were feared as a cursed band of 
assassins and despised because of that.</i>

02:19.130 --> 02:25.690
<i>Long before he met Bojji, a young Kage 
lived in seclusion with his mother.</i>

02:33.580 --> 02:35.230
He's shadow clan!

02:35.230 --> 02:36.330
Wh-What?

02:36.330 --> 02:39.930
They say that the shadow clan 
bullies all sorts of people!

02:42.040 --> 02:45.720
The mighty knight Kyo will 
do away with bad folks!

02:45.720 --> 02:46.540
Huh?!

02:49.620 --> 02:51.260
Hold it!

02:51.460 --> 02:53.740
Stop running away, villain!

02:55.830 --> 02:59.040
<i>We are a clan of assassins.</i>

02:59.520 --> 03:03.690
From time to time, we have to target 
women, children, and even the elderly.

03:04.430 --> 03:08.030
Those of us in the shadow clan are 
very much hated by everyone else.

03:12.130 --> 03:14.000
So no matter what happens,

03:14.390 --> 03:17.030
no one is ever going to help us.

03:18.110 --> 03:19.760
You have to become strong.

03:23.660 --> 03:28.490
<i>Am I going to have to live 
my whole life that way, too?</i>

03:29.280 --> 03:31.550
Rats! Where did he go?!

03:31.550 --> 03:33.700
Aw, let's let him go.

03:34.060 --> 03:36.940
The next time I see him, 
I'll get him for sure!

03:37.160 --> 03:41.700
When I grow up, I'm gonna be 
a mighty knight like Sir Kyo!

03:42.620 --> 03:44.530
I wonder if I can be a knight, too!

03:44.530 --> 03:45.900
Me, too!

04:08.860 --> 04:11.230
Okay, time for bed, Kage.

04:11.230 --> 04:11.980
Mm-hmm.

04:15.770 --> 04:17.010
<i>Mommy...</i>

04:22.540 --> 04:24.560
Go! Go!

04:24.560 --> 04:25.610
Get 'em!

04:43.620 --> 04:47.380
Look, Kage! Bullfighting, one of 
the Kingdom of Bo's attractions!

04:52.250 --> 04:53.760
I'm scared, Mommy!

04:54.900 --> 04:56.270
Come on, let's go.

04:56.270 --> 04:59.110
Kage, you sure are a gentle soul, huh?

05:09.390 --> 05:11.650
I'll take this one and... that one, please.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.510
Thank you.

05:21.560 --> 05:23.340
Let's go, Kage.

05:23.340 --> 05:23.960
Mm-hmm.

05:28.680 --> 05:30.670
Sir Kyo is coming through!

05:34.080 --> 05:35.190
What's the matter?

05:35.460 --> 05:36.590
Nothing...

05:38.240 --> 05:42.700
Tonight we're having your favorite, 
Kage—Mommy's specially-made soup!

05:42.700 --> 05:45.110
Really? Hooray!

05:53.780 --> 05:55.450
Wait right here for me, okay?

05:55.450 --> 05:56.180
Mm-hmm.

06:00.180 --> 06:01.060
Ah!

06:15.860 --> 06:17.530
A butterfly!

06:20.070 --> 06:21.500
Wait up!

06:29.970 --> 06:34.420
Amazing! It's really him! The greatest 
knight in the Kingdom of Bo!

06:34.730 --> 06:36.250
Sir Kyo!

06:41.940 --> 06:43.090
Wait up!

06:49.130 --> 06:51.290
<i>One of the shadow clan...</i>

06:54.980 --> 06:58.160
I found you! Today's the 
day I take you down!

06:58.160 --> 06:58.670
Wah!

06:59.950 --> 07:01.390
Hold it!

07:01.390 --> 07:03.270
Stop running away!

07:04.370 --> 07:06.640
Somebody stop it!

07:06.640 --> 07:07.310
Huh?

07:15.620 --> 07:17.590
<i>H-Have to run away!</i>

07:20.940 --> 07:21.780
Hurry!

07:24.120 --> 07:25.560
Hurry, I said!

07:44.360 --> 07:45.530
Incredible!

07:45.530 --> 07:46.990
Get the bull! Hurry!

07:48.980 --> 07:50.950
That's it, hold him down.

07:56.730 --> 08:00.840
Th-Thank you very much. What's your name?

08:02.150 --> 08:04.590
A knight is someone who 
keeps the people safe.

08:04.590 --> 08:06.340
My name is of no importance.

08:07.430 --> 08:11.720
What you did is not something many 
would have done. Take pride.

08:17.190 --> 08:18.540
How cool!

08:18.540 --> 08:19.200
Hey...

08:29.310 --> 08:30.670
Kage!

08:31.710 --> 08:32.690
Mommy!

08:32.690 --> 08:35.080
Oh, I've been looking for you!

08:36.420 --> 08:38.030
Did something happen?

08:38.030 --> 08:40.820
Mommy, I wanna be a knight!

08:40.820 --> 08:42.250
Huh? A knight?

08:42.250 --> 08:44.780
Mm-hmm. And ride on a fine horse,

08:44.780 --> 08:46.840
and carry a big sword...

08:47.700 --> 08:51.250
I'm gonna protect you, 
Mommy, and everyone else!

09:16.220 --> 09:17.790
Someday, please make sure...

09:19.130 --> 09:22.010
that my little one's dream comes true.

09:26.950 --> 09:31.910
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

09:33.210 --> 09:36.130
<i>Bosse entered into an 
agreement with the demon</i>

09:36.130 --> 09:38.740
<i>to gain the greatest strength in the world.</i>

09:39.400 --> 09:41.810
<i>What the demon sought in payment</i>

09:41.810 --> 09:44.760
<i>was the power of someone 
related by blood to Bosse.</i>

09:49.880 --> 09:51.520
I want you to marry me,

09:51.790 --> 09:53.440
and bear my child.

09:54.700 --> 09:58.750
M-My only pursuit is strength.

09:59.460 --> 10:02.860
I want to be the strongest man in the world.

10:03.450 --> 10:05.320
That is my dream,

10:05.840 --> 10:07.770
and I <i>will</i> make it come true!

10:13.030 --> 10:14.190
Show me what you've got.

10:15.180 --> 10:16.540
All right.

10:22.600 --> 10:27.600
<b>A Great Mother</b>

10:23.160 --> 10:25.180
This is a great place.

10:25.680 --> 10:29.990
Yeah. I feel calm whenever I come here.

10:36.600 --> 10:39.480
I'm starting to get a little hungry.

10:43.330 --> 10:44.860
I'll take care of that!

11:06.700 --> 11:07.620
Why, you...

11:08.990 --> 11:10.270
Bosse!

11:13.380 --> 11:14.440
Heads up!

11:17.480 --> 11:18.450
W-Wait!

11:26.370 --> 11:27.290
Now!

11:52.110 --> 11:53.700
They look ready.

11:56.230 --> 11:57.570
Let's eat.

12:00.450 --> 12:01.840
It's good!

12:01.840 --> 12:02.830
Yeah.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.990
You surprised me earlier.

12:09.990 --> 12:12.940
The strongest woman in the world, indeed.

12:14.590 --> 12:16.960
That didn't even scratch the surface.

12:17.200 --> 12:20.870
Give me a break! I couldn't 
handle anything more.

12:21.220 --> 12:25.160
I'm going to get even stronger.

12:26.830 --> 12:29.380
You aren't content with being 
the strongest already?

12:30.210 --> 12:31.100
Nope.

12:32.740 --> 12:34.600
I recently realized something.

12:35.110 --> 12:40.280
Strength isn't for yourself. 
It's for those around you, you know?

12:41.370 --> 12:45.080
I can get even stronger, if I'm 
doing it for someone else.

12:57.050 --> 12:58.120
My...

12:58.570 --> 13:00.580
you're covered in the blood of others.

13:01.010 --> 13:03.980
And here a new life has been born, too.

13:04.510 --> 13:05.630
Forgive me.

13:06.460 --> 13:07.320
Look,

13:08.770 --> 13:10.150
he's a boy.

13:16.620 --> 13:20.800
But with both of us being giants,
 he sure is little.

13:24.940 --> 13:27.390
Still, he's a big cutie.

13:40.540 --> 13:44.020
I give up. What are we going to do?

13:44.460 --> 13:45.960
Let me take care of it.

13:46.570 --> 13:47.900
King Bosse...

13:49.120 --> 13:50.560
Get back.

13:59.900 --> 14:02.720
Okay, everyone pitch in!

14:11.950 --> 14:14.430
Thanks so much, King Bosse.

14:20.930 --> 14:23.670
King Bosse, we can take it from here.

14:24.330 --> 14:29.400
Let me do this. I want to make this 
a town that's livable for all.

14:33.940 --> 14:36.070
We'll give you a hand, too.

14:59.850 --> 15:02.050
Thief!

15:02.050 --> 15:04.380
Somebody, stop her!

15:19.020 --> 15:21.590
We can't have people stealing.

15:23.210 --> 15:24.690
Give it back!

15:24.690 --> 15:28.150
Honestly! What would your mother think?!

15:30.580 --> 15:32.750
Don't you have anything to say?!

15:35.150 --> 15:39.120
My father is hurt, and he lost his job.

15:39.750 --> 15:42.480
Getting by is hard now, and I just...

15:43.570 --> 15:45.790
I truly am sorry.

15:47.390 --> 15:50.750
Hmph, I don't need to hear any excuses.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.970
If that's the truth,

15:55.640 --> 15:57.670
then I will hire you.

15:59.070 --> 16:02.780
In return, I'm going to ask 
that you work hard, all right?

16:02.780 --> 16:04.730
I'm pretty strict.

16:05.020 --> 16:06.690
Yes!

16:08.220 --> 16:10.620
It isn't right that she stole your bread.

16:10.620 --> 16:13.900
But it also isn't right to 
hate her for stealing it.

16:15.580 --> 16:19.580
Next time, come and buy from 
me with money you've earned.

16:21.190 --> 16:24.140
My bread <i>is</i> exceptionally good, after all.

16:33.500 --> 16:34.630
We're under attack.

16:40.760 --> 16:44.370
Everyone, remain calm! Keep your heads
 about you and defend yourselves!

16:51.200 --> 16:53.980
Keep calm and head for the center of town!

17:08.320 --> 17:09.410
It's all right.

17:10.010 --> 17:12.470
I know Bosse will protect us.

17:25.450 --> 17:27.060
Your father...

17:27.500 --> 17:29.610
is very strong.

17:41.450 --> 17:43.200
King Bosse!

17:43.200 --> 17:44.420
Thank you!

17:47.050 --> 17:48.360
Bosse!

17:50.970 --> 17:52.490
Welcome back.

17:54.840 --> 17:56.080
I'm home.

17:59.500 --> 18:01.970
I'm back, Bojji.

18:06.220 --> 18:08.430
Hey, did he just...?

18:10.320 --> 18:12.610
It sounded like he was calling out to you.

18:12.970 --> 18:14.230
Bojji...

18:36.420 --> 18:38.420
What brings you here today?

18:39.980 --> 18:42.390
I'll get right to the point.

18:42.710 --> 18:47.390
You currently stand a very real chance 
of achieving the highest ranking.

18:49.530 --> 18:53.320
Why not take this opportunity 
to try for first place?

18:55.410 --> 18:57.590
Have you settled in to your job here?

18:57.950 --> 19:01.080
Yes, thanks to you, Queen Shiina.

19:01.080 --> 19:04.000
My father's injury is doing 
much better now, too.

19:04.000 --> 19:05.990
I'm glad to hear it.

19:07.240 --> 19:11.450
I bought some bread from 
that stand the other day.

19:12.600 --> 19:14.500
It tasted so good.

19:15.120 --> 19:16.430
You don't say.

19:21.950 --> 19:25.270
That girl seems to be working quite hard.

19:25.270 --> 19:28.740
Yeah. She's quite bright, 
too, and very attentive.

19:29.030 --> 19:31.430
But never mind her. Have you 
finished your business?

19:32.010 --> 19:33.100
Yeah.

19:33.620 --> 19:36.990
Why not take this opportunity 
to try for first place?

19:41.120 --> 19:42.030
No thanks.

19:42.660 --> 19:44.870
I have no interest in that.

19:44.870 --> 19:50.260
If you gain the highest ranking, I will 
show you to the Divine Treasure Vault.

19:51.340 --> 19:55.340
That is not the reason why I became a king.

19:58.040 --> 19:59.500
And there you have it.

19:59.780 --> 20:03.120
Are you sure? If you earned 
the highest ranking,

20:03.120 --> 20:06.420
you might be able to obtain the 
greatest strength in the world.

20:08.420 --> 20:11.700
That's okay. I don't need it anymore.

20:13.160 --> 20:15.090
You sure have changed.

20:17.930 --> 20:21.310
Yeah. I have you two to thank for that.

20:34.360 --> 20:38.840
I will provide a life for my son 
where he will want for nothing.

20:38.840 --> 20:41.830
I've realized <i>that</i> is my mission.

20:42.690 --> 20:45.160
I have to keep the boy safe.

20:45.770 --> 20:49.360
Bojji is so small and fragile, after all.

20:49.590 --> 20:53.050
Oh, no. Someday, he will grow up big.

20:53.520 --> 20:56.990
And not just his body, 
either. His heart, as well.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.570
It's all right.

20:59.710 --> 21:02.120
I'm sure someday...

21:02.120 --> 21:04.420
Bojji will become a fine king himself.

21:20.420 --> 21:32.430
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.730 --> 21:41.440
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:41.440 --> 21:46.570
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:47.070 --> 21:50.080
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:50.080 --> 21:52.910
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.910 --> 21:58.580
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.580 --> 22:01.500
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:01.500 --> 22:04.300
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:04.300 --> 22:14.100
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:14.520 --> 22:20.270
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:20.270 --> 22:27.700
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.700 --> 22:32.280
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:32.280 --> 22:38.750
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:49.090
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
